{"found": true, "answer": "The passages describe several appeal routes for a refused long-stay visa. First, you can file an informal appeal (recours gracieux) with the consulate, asking it to reconsider its decision. Second, you can refer the matter to the Commission de recours contre les décisions de refus de visa d'entrée en France (CRRV), but only by mail. This CRRV appeal is mandatory before you can go to the administrative court, and you must file it within 30 days of written notification of the refusal (or of an implicit refusal, if the consulate has not replied within 2 months). Your appeal must state the legal and factual grounds, be written in French, be signed, and include any useful documents. If the CRRV rejects your appeal, or if the ministers uphold the refusal despite a favourable CRRV opinion, you can bring an annulment appeal within 2 months before the administrative court of Nantes. The passages do not say whether a student visa has any different rules from other long-stay visas.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "En cas de refus de votre demande de visa, vous pouvez former un"}, {"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "Vous pouvez aussi saisir la Commission de recours contre les décisions de refus de visa d'entrée en France (CRRV) par courrier uniquement."}, {"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "avant tout recours devant le juge administratif. Vous devez impérativement le présenter dans"}, {"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "un délai de 30 jours"}, {"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "Vous devez motiver votre recours (exposer les éléments de droit et de fait). Vous devez le rédiger en français, le signer et joindre tout document utile."}, {"chunk_id": "F16162", "quote": "Si la CRRV rejette votre recours, ou si les ministres confirment le refus de visa malgré l'avis favorable de la CRRV, vous pouvez former, dans les 2 mois, un recours en annulation. Ce recours doit être déposé auprès du tribunal administratif de Nantes."}]}
